      "twitterUrl": "https://twitter.com/MJStacking/status/1944432772870758580",
      "text": "$NAKA | @NakamotoGames\n\nAnother Sunday, another savage week of execution across the most relentless GameFi ecosystem in #Web3.\n\nHere’s what went down this week 👇\n\nMONDAY\nStarted strong with two major engines firing:\n\n• $NAKA Boom entered final prep, the Web3 bomber game everyone’s waiting for. Launch is near. 💣\n• Watch2Earn is LIVE → Watch ads, spin the Lucky Wheel, and grind for that $1 Ticket.\n• Works on Web, PWA & Android - rewards are waiting. 🎡\n\nTUESDAY\nMass adoption play goes full throttle:\n\n• $NAKA launched in-app ads in India, Vietnam & the Philippines.\n• A bold Web2 → Web3 funnel targeting hyper-casual gamers where it counts.\n• Streaming gameplay directly from the app also got kicked off.\n→ Share, go viral and drive adoption.\n\nWEDNESDAY\nA brand new game reveal: Trick or Seek\n\n• Multiplayer hide-and-seek in a neon anime world.\n• Switch roles. Cause chaos. Hunt spirits.\n• Gameplay is fire. Aesthetic is retro-futuristic madness.\n• Coming soon to Playland and ready to flip the genre on its head.\n\nAlso: the countdown to the next $1 to Earn tournament started ticking...\n\nTHURSDAY\nBOOM. $1 to Earn Tournament went live!\n\n• Jump into Sky Hover, turn $1 into $100.\n• All hosted on the app - fast, fair, rewarding.\n• $NAKA Boom hit final bug testing + UI polish.\n→ Full launch window: August\n\nFRIDAY\nNo matter the market, $NAKA builds.\n\n• Team doubled down during the bear.\n• Now they’re going ALL-IN as interest returns.\n• The goal? To take $NAKA fully mainstream.\n• App-ready, name conflict solved.\n• UX/UI upgrades locked in.\n• Mobile fun at its peak.\n\nAlso: say hello to Fall Race (formerly Rumble Party)\n\nSATURDAY\n Blazor is heating up:\n\n• Deep gameplay testing, bug fixes, UI redesign in the works.\n• Balancing power-ups and polishing combat to perfection.\n• Launching in August. This is tactical GameFi done right.\n\nAlso: $NAKA Farm Island earnings now unlocked. Get in, stack up. 🌾\n\nSUNDAY\nClosed the week with power moves:\n\n• Sushi Match NEXT submitted to iOS - sleek, fast and P2E-ready.\n• And the big one: XSwap is LIVE → Fiat to $NAKA now smooth, secure, seamless.\n\nThis ecosystem doesn’t sleep.\nThis team doesn’t slow down.\nThis is what real building looks like.\n\nI'm Scooping.\n\nThey are the blueprint.\nWatch them dominate.\nLet’s keep it rolling, \n 🔥🎮",
